plot() and summary() worked. Thanks Chris, I cannot tell you what a life saver you are! Threads on this group are a wealth of resources to current and future CTMM users.

For others going down this path, the overlap example gets you the aligned utilization distributions (UDS in example) and then you can implement the mean() function like so...

#average home ranges
x <-mean(UDS)

#plot and summary statistics
plot(yourtelemetrylocations, UD=x)
summary(x)

